[I] Minimal implementation of the R7RS scheme standard

[T] Chibi-Scheme is a very small R7RS Scheme implementation intended for use
[T] as an extension and scripting language in C programs. It supports
[T] lightweight VM-based threads in isolated heaps, a full numeric tower,
[T] Unicode and hygienic macros, without external dependencies.

[U] https://github.com/ashinn/chibi-scheme

[A] Chibi-scheme Authors
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

